  "details": "If some GameObject in a scene has EventSystem component without StandaloneInputModule, Game window showing \"Configure World\" doesn't response to any operation (clicking or typing) then you can't finish publishing.\n\nWarning massage appears in Console window:\n\n    Multiple EventSystems in scene... this is not supported\n    UnityEngine.Object:Instantiate(Object)\n    VRC.Core.PipelineManager:Start()\n\nAbstract in Japanese:\nStandaloneInputModule を伴わない EventSystem がシーンに有ると \"Configure World\" の画面が操作できなくなり、publish 操作を完了できない。",
